<title>JAPAN: NCB aims to complete loan write-offs by end-97/98.</title>
<headline>NCB aims to complete loan write-offs by end-97/98.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Credit Bank Ltd said on Monday that it aims to complete writing off its non-performing loans by the end of 1997/98 at the earliest.</p>
</text>
